    "description": {
      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates using pin bars only when location and structure agree using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示仅在位置与结构一致时使用针形K线。"
    },
